
# Ansible Control Center (ACC)

**A self-hosted infrastructure management, monitoring, and Kubernetes operations platform.**

Ansible Control Center (ACC) is a Linux-based administration platform designed to simplify the management of multiple servers and Kubernetes clusters from a single terminal interface.

Built around Ansible, Python, SSH, systemd, and MicroK8s, ACC provides centralized server administration, infrastructure health monitoring, high-availability membership verification, backup visibility, and controlled system maintenance.

The project focuses on practical infrastructure management using open-source technologies, without requiring commercial monitoring platforms or cloud-based management services.

**Project Status:** Active Development  
**Current Platform:** ACC v6.3.0-dev4 terminal interface with v6.2 management components  
