## Architecture

```text
              Fedora Linux
          +--------------------+
          | Ansible Control    |
          | Center (ACC)       |
          |                    |
          | Terminal Dashboard |
          | Ansible Controller |
          | Monitoring Engine  |
          | SQLite Telemetry   |
          | Backup Reporting   |
          +---------+----------+
                    |
               SSH / Ansible
                    |
       +------------+------------+
       |            |            |
    node1        node2        node6
   HA Master    HA Master    HA Master
       |            |            |
       +------------+------------+
                    |
             MicroK8s Cluster
                    |
             +------+------+
             |             |
           node4         node5
           Worker        Worker
```

The controller manages infrastructure remotely. Monitoring data and operational status are gathered from the managed nodes.

