## Quick Start

ACC currently represents a working deployment and an actively developed management platform.

A public, reproducible installation procedure is still being prepared. Installation requirements, dependencies, example inventory files, and supported configuration options will be published as the project is packaged for distribution.

### Existing Deployment Commands

Launch the main interface:

```bash
ansible-menu
```

Launch the classic management interface:

```bash
ansible-menu-classic
```

Display a status summary:

```bash
ansible-menu --status
```

View infrastructure alerts:

```bash
ansible-menu --alerts
```

Display host details:

```bash
ansible-menu --details
```

Check the monitoring timer:

```bash
systemctl --user status acc-monitor.timer
```

These commands are available in the configured ACC deployment; they are not yet a complete installation guide for a new system.

