## Example Deployment

The current reference deployment consists of:

- 1 Fedora-based management controller.
- 5 Ubuntu Server nodes.
- 3 MicroK8s high-availability control-plane nodes.
- 2 MicroK8s worker nodes.
- Centralized monitoring and administration.
- Off-node Kubernetes control-plane backup storage.

The deployment has been verified with five Kubernetes nodes Ready, seven Kubernetes system pods healthy, and consistent three-master HA membership.

